<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Skunks aren’t born with</l><l>Wings like a butterfly,</l><l>Carrot seeds don’t grow to be</l><l>Sequoias reaching to the sky!</l><l>Plants make plants and</l><l>Animals make animals:</l><l>Each according to its kind!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
